# Patch 005: API Boundary Validation & Defensive Runtime Hardening
Files Changed:
- src/core/config/api.ts
- src/components/OwnerControlCenter.tsx
- src/components/ExperienceRuntime.tsx
- src/components/ueos/*

Reason:
Ensure all frontend API calls pass through the UEOS API Gateway (/api/v1/* and /api/ueos/*) and that all array maps across rendering paths feature defensive `(array || []).map()` guards to prevent `undefined.map()` crashes.

Architectural Impact:
Guarantees robust Zero-Trust API isolation between client UI and backend database/kernel services, while eliminating client runtime exceptions.

Rollback Information:
Revert edits in src/core/config/api.ts and component files.
